      <uighur>ǰerkelke - ǰerkelgen</uighur>
      <cyrillic>зэрэглээ</cyrillic>
      <transcript>ZERGELGE(N)</transcript>
      <definition>[= zirgelgen] n. Mirage, fata morgana; phantom; optical illusion.</definition>
      <page>1046</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠵᠡᠷᠺᠡᠯᠺᠡ ᠲᠠᠲᠠᠬᠤ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- tataxu</transcript>
          <definition>For a mirage to form.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠡᠳᠺᠢᠺᠦᠢ ᠠᠨᠤ ᠵᠡᠷᠺᠡᠯᠨ ᠮᠡᠲᠦ ᠪᠤᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>sedkikyi anu --n mety bui</transcript>
          <definition>Thought is like a phantom.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
